        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "PO: (Immediate-Release): ADULTS, ELDERLY: Initially, 25 mg twice daily, then increase in 25–50-mg increments divided 2–3 times/day on the second and third days, up to 300–400 mg/day in 2–3 divided doses by the fourth day. Further adjustments of 25–50 mg twice daily may be made at intervals of 2 days or longer. Maintenance: 150–750 mg/day (adults); 50–200 mg/day (elderly). (Extended-Release): Initially, 300 mg/day. May increase at intervals as short as 1 day up to 300 mg/day. Range: 400–800 mg/day. (Immediate-Release): CHILDREN 13 YRS AND OLDER: Initially, 25 mg twice daily on day 1, 50 mg twice daily on day 2, then increase by 100 mg/day to target dose of 400 mg twice daily on day 5. May further increase to 800 mg/day in increments of 100 mg or less daily. Range: 400–800 mg/day. Maximum: 800 mg. Total dose in 3 divided doses. (Extended-Release): Initially, 50 mg once daily on day 1, 100 mg on day 2, until 400 mg once daily is reached on day 5. Range: 400–800 mg/day. Maximum: 800 mg/day.",
